      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. One thing though—some of these maps are really strange. Like, there are these little sketches in the margins of things that don't seem to correspond to the actual geography, and the creators are completely anonymous. If I start using terms like \"Unknown,\" does that imply we haven't looked hard enough, or is there a way to categorize them that acknowledges they might be intentionally anonymous or just something fundamentally unidentifiable by standard archival methods?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
